el suppresses expected warnings for the deliberately\\n+# uninterpreted symbolic string-at-index function.\\n+kprove spec.k \\\\\\n+  --definition verification-kompiled \\\\\\n+  --spec-module SPEC \\\\\\n+  --output pretty \\\\\\n+  --warnings none \\\\\\n+  --haskell-backend-command 'kore-exec --log-level error'\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));","internal_chat_message_me
